  "details": "<p><em>The Barrington Atlas Directory</em> notes: Villa Pamphili, S. Pancrazio, basilica, and catacombs. It is important to note, then, that this encompasses several discrete places within the footprint of the\u00a0<span>Villa Pamphili.</span></p>",
